Description
Import a data source from a local path or zip file

Usage: musoq data-sources import <PATH> [--format <FORMAT>] [--name <NAME>]
       [--non-interactive]

Arguments
  <PATH>  Local directory path or .zip file to import

Options
  --format <FORMAT>  Output format: text or json Default: text. Allowed values:
                     text, json.
  --name <NAME>, -n  Custom name for the imported data source (default: derived
                     from path)
  --non-interactive  Output progress as plain text instead of interactive
                     progress bar

Examples
data-sources import /path/to/plugin
data-sources import C:\Downloads\plugin.zip
data-sources import /path/to/plugin --name my-plugin
datasource import /path/to/plugin
datasource import C:\Downloads\plugin.zip
datasource import /path/to/plugin --name my-plugin
